+    """Build the shared evolution view for native benchmark traces.
+
+    Native adapters already persist the same Skill-MAS build stages and tool
+    events as the other backends.  Reuse the established stage trimmer and
+    internal trace summary rather than introducing a native-only truncation
+    policy.  Large execution state and raw model usage are deliberately left
+    on disk and are not copied into optimizer prompts.
+    """
+    task_description = str(raw.get("task_description") or raw.get("prompt") or "")
